#: ../../source/templates_expo.md:212
msgid ""
"**Shadow Philosophy**: Expo uses shadows as gentle whispers rather than "
"architectural statements. The primary depth mechanism is **background "
"color contrast** — white cards floating on Cloud Gray — rather than "
"shadow casting. When shadows appear, they're soft, diffused, and "
"directional (downward), creating the feeling of paper hovering "
"millimeters above a desk."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_expo.md:214
msgid "7. Do's and Don'ts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_expo.md:216
msgid "Do"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_expo.md:217
msgid ""
"Use Cloud Gray (`#f0f0f3`) as the page background and Pure White "
"(`#ffffff`) for elevated cards — the two-tone light system is essential"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_expo.md:218
msgid ""
"Keep display headlines at extreme negative letter-spacing (-1.6px to -3px"
" at 64px) for the signature compressed look"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_expo.md:219
msgid ""
"Use pill-shaped (9999px) radius for primary CTA buttons — the organic "
"shape is core to the identity"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_expo.md:220
msgid ""
"Reserve black (`#000000`) for headlines and primary CTAs — it carries "
"maximum authority on the light canvas"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_expo.md:221
msgid ""
"Use Slate Gray (`#60646c`) for secondary text — it's the precise balance "
"between readable and receded"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_expo.md:222
msgid ""
"Maintain enormous vertical spacing between sections (96px+) — the gallery"
" pacing defines the premium feel"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_expo.md:223
msgid ""
"Use product screenshots as the primary visual content — the interface "
"stays monochrome, the products bring color"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_expo.md:224
msgid ""
"Apply Inter at the full weight range (400–900) — weight contrast IS the "
"hierarchy"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_expo.md:226
msgid "Don't"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_expo.md:227
msgid ""
"Don't introduce decorative colors into the interface chrome — the "
"monochromatic palette is intentional"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_expo.md:228
msgid ""
"Don't use sharp corners (border-radius < 6px) on interactive elements — "
"the pill/rounded geometry is the signature"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_expo.md:229
msgid "Don't reduce section spacing below 64px — the breathing room is the design"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_expo.md:230
msgid ""
"Don't use heavy drop shadows — depth comes from background contrast and "
"whisper-soft shadows"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_expo.md:231
msgid ""
"Don't mix in additional typefaces — Inter handles everything from display"
" to caption"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_expo.md:232
msgid ""
"Don't use letter-spacing wider than -0.25px on body text — extreme "
"tracking is reserved for display only"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_expo.md:233
msgid ""
"Don't use borders heavier than 2px — containment is subtle, achieved "
"through background color and gentle borders"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_expo.md:234
msgid ""
"Don't add gradients to the interface — visual richness comes from "
"content, not decoration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_expo.md:235
msgid ""
"Don't use saturated colors outside of semantic contexts — the palette is "
"strictly grayscale + functional blue"
msgstr ""

